   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Is the solution strategy used in solving the linear equation correct? If it is correct, show the final step (check the solution). If it is not correct, explain why.<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{7 + 4\\left( {2 + 5x} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{3\\left( {6x + 7} \\right)-\\left( {13x + 36} \\right)}\\\\{7 + 8 + 20x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18x + 21-13x-36}\\\\{15 + 20x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{5x-15}\\\\{15 + 20x\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,5\\mathit{x}}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{5x-15\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,5\\mathit{x}}}}\\\\{15 + 15x\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,15}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- 15\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,15}}}\\\\{15x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,30}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,2}\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}{7 + 4\\left( {2 + 5x} \\right)}&amp;{ = }&amp;{3\\left( {6x + 7} \\right)-\\left( {13x + 36} \\right)}\\\\{7 + 8 + 20x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{18x + 21-13x-36}\\\\{15 + 20x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{5x-15}\\\\{15 + 20x\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,5\\mathit{x}}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{5x-15\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,5\\mathit{x}}}}\\\\{15 + 15x\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,15}}}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- 15\\,{\\mathbf{-\\,15}}}\\\\{15x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,30}\\\\{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,2}\\end{array}</span>",
