     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "It is a correct solution strategy.<br>\nLet<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\begin{array}{rcl}{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,2}\\\\{7 + 4\\left( {2 + 5\\left( { - \\,2} \\right)} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( {6\\left( { -\\,2} \\right) + 7} \\right)-\\left( {13\\left( { -\\,2} \\right) + 36} \\right)}\\\\{7 + 4\\left( {2-10} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( { - 12 + 7} \\right)-\\left( { -\\,26 + 36} \\right) }\\\\{7 + 4\\left( { -\\,8} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( { - 5} \\right)-\\left( {10} \\right) }\\\\{7-32}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{ -\\,15-10}\\\\{-\\,25}&amp;{ = }&amp;{-\\,25✓}\\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{rcl}{x}&amp;{ = }&amp;{- \\,2}\\\\{7 + 4\\left( {2 + 5\\left( { - \\,2} \\right)} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( {6\\left( { -\\,2} \\right) + 7} \\right)-\\left( {13\\left( { -\\,2} \\right) + 36} \\right)}\\\\{7 + 4\\left( {2-10} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( { - 12 + 7} \\right)-\\left( { -\\,26 + 36} \\right) }\\\\{7 + 4\\left( { -\\,8} \\right)}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{3\\left( { - 5} \\right)-\\left( {10} \\right) }\\\\{7-32}&amp;{ \\mathop  = \\limits^? }&amp;{ -\\,15-10}\\\\{-\\,25}&amp;{ = }&amp;{-\\,25✓}\\end{array}</span>"
